[header]
missionType = "Tutorial"
missionNumber = 8
moreGeysers = 1
myStartMoney = 10000
myTech="thunderbattery;thundercannon;thunderblocker;thunderfence;bulf;windbattery;windarcher;windblocker;windaviary;windwalker;windballoon;suncannon;sunarcher;sunballoon;sunfence"


ai2Name = "Florence"
ai2Tech="windbattery;sunwalker;suncannon;sunarcher;sunaviary;sunblocker;sunballoon;sunfence"
ai2StartMoney = 6000
ai2GeyserAttachments = 10
ai2Collectors = 15
ai2TimeBetweenMoves = 1
ai2AllyList = "3"
ai2AllyList = "1"

ai3Name = "Sun Prince"
ai3Tech="thunderbattery;thunderfence;thunderblocker;suncannon;sunarcher;sunwalker;sunballoon;bulf"
ai3StartMoney = 7500
ai3GeyserAttachments = 10
ai3Collectors = 20
ai3TimeBetweenMoves = 1
ai3AllyList = "2"

title = "Unwanted Guests"

[Options]
[A.]
<h2>~mUnwanted Guests</h2>
<br><i>~INemo repente fuit turpissimus.<br>
<br>--unknown author<br></i>
<p>
While you were away battleing, one of your servants has been ambushed by the <i>~rSun Prince</i>.
He couldn't hold out for long enough for you to arrive and save him, so he capitulated.
Now he fights for the <i>~rSun Prince</i>. You must find a way to save him.
$Button=More,Tell,More

[More]
<h2>~gA message from the prince of the Chidory</h2>
<br>I am sorry master, but I can't fight along side with you today,
it seems that while I was away, my Island also got attacked, and now I must defend it.<br>
<br>I shall keep in touch with you, and report how things are going back here.<br>
$Button=O.K. - we'll keep in touch,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Start Mission,DoNothing,0
$Button=This can wait - I'll come to your aid,MissionBegin,Chidory
$Button=Bail,MissionAbort,1

[@120]
<h2>~yA message from Florence</h2>
Master, I knew you'd come, but I can't help you because I'm
trapped in a Force Field. If you kill the <i>~rSun Prince</i> then I
will be free.
$Button=O.K.,DoNothing,0

[@180]
<h2><i>~gThe master of the Chidory sends you a message:</h2></i>
<br>Master, the odds aren't looking any good here, I wish you were here, to help me, but no matter.
Hopefuly I can outwhip this.
$Button=Now there's nothing I can't do to help you,DoNothing,0


[ai3PriestCaptured]
~yI can feel that the forcefield is fading master!
$Button=Just a little longer,DoNothing,0

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>~gThank you master</h2>
<br>thank you for freeing me! And now I shall rule this place! It is time...
for you to <i>~DIE!</i><br>
$Button=Oh realy?!,DoNothing,0


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>~mVictory!</h2>
You have defeated the <i>~rSun Priest</i>!
But it looks like it was too late for your former ally, he wanted ultimate power, and now he is in hell with the rest of your enemies.
$Button=More,Tell,Ally

[Ally]
<h2>~gA message from you ally</h2><br>
Help me master! I've lost the war, and the enemy has captured me!<br>
Please hurry!
$Button=End Mission,MissionAbort,1
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Resque

[Failed]
<h2>You've failed to achieve victory!</h2>

[End] 